{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f7f9fb;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#2b6cb0;--accent-2:#7c3aed;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#ffffff 60%);color:#0f172a}
    .page{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}
    nav a.active{color:var(--accent)}

    .hero{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px;align-items:start;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(12,17,36,0.06);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');opacity:0.08;mix-blend-mode:overlay}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .panel{background:var(--glass);padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;color:#0f172a}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.08);margin-top:6px;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:84px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(43,108,176,0.16)}

    /* widgets */
    .widget{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(12,17,36,0.04)}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .col{flex:1}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fbfdff;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(12,17,36,0.04);margin-top:10px;font-size:13px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    footer{margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    @media(max-width:900px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      nav{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='page'>
    <header>
      <div class='brand'>
        <div class='logo'>PT</div>
        <div>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class='small'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='about.html'>Practice</a>
        <a href='specialties.html'>Services</a>
        <a href='approach.html'>Method</a>
        <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>
        <a href='faq.html'>Help</a>
        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
        <a href='contact.html' class='active'>Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class='hero' aria-labelledby='connectHeading'>
      <div>
        <h1 id='connectHeading'>Connect with a clinician who maps the next clear step</h1>
        <p class='lead'>Use the tools on this page to summarize what matters most and bring a focused plan to your first meeting. No diagnoses here—just preparation to make our time together efficient and kind.</p>
        <div style='margin-top:14px' class='panel'>
          <form id='contactForm' autocomplete='off'>
            <label for='name'>Your name</label>
            <input id='name' name='name' type='text' placeholder='First & last name'>

            <label for='email'>Email</label>
            <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='you@domain.com'>

            <label for='phone'>Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id='phone' name='phone' type='text' placeholder='{{PHONE}}'>

            <label for='message'>A short note (optional)</label>
            <textarea id='message' name='message' placeholder='A sentence about what brings you here'></textarea>

            <div style='display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center'>
              <button class='btn' type='button' id='primarySend'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <button class='btn ghost' type='button' id='plannerOpen'>Use Session Planner</button>
              <div class='muted' style='margin-left:auto'>Prefer phone? <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:12px' class='small'>
          Confidentiality and limits: conversations are confidential within usual clinical limits (safety, legal). This site is not for crisis response. If you are in crisis or risk harm to yourself/others, please contact emergency services or your local crisis line.
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='widget'>
          <h3 style='margin:0 0 6px'>Session Planner</h3>
          <div class='muted'>Create a compact series plan for your first 4 sessions and copy a plain-text summary to bring to our meeting.</div>

          <label for='focus'>Primary focus for work</label>
          <input id='focus' type='text' placeholder='e.g., motivation for change, relationship tension, grief'>

          <div class='row' style='margin-top:8px'>
            <div class='col'>
              <label for='freq'>Frequency</label>
              <select id='freq'>
                <option>Weekly</option>
                <option>Biweekly</option>
                <option>Every other week</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class='col'>
              <label for='length'>Session length</label>
              <select id='length'>
                <option>50 minutes</option>
                <option>75 minutes</option>
                <option>25 minutes</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for='goal'>A short goal you'd like to work toward</label>
          <input id='goal' type='text' placeholder='One clear goal (one sentence)'>

          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
            <button class='btn' id='buildPlan' type='button'>Build plan</button>
            <button class='btn ghost' id='clearPlan' type='button'>Reset</button>
          </div>

          <div id='planOutput' class='output' aria-live='polite'>Your planner summary will appear here.</div>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px'>
            <button class='btn' id='copyPlan' type='button'>Copy summary</button>
            <button class='btn ghost' id='downloadPlan' type='button'>Download .txt</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='widget' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <h3 style='margin:0 0 6px'>Self-screening intake — bring these to the consult</h3>
          <div class='muted'>Answer a few brief prompts to generate a short list of talking points and questions for our first session.</div>

          <label for='concerns'>Three quick concerns (comma separated)</label>
          <input id='concerns' type='text' placeholder='e.g., low energy, argument patterns, decision fatigue'>

          <label for='duration'>How long has this been present?</label>
          <select id='duration'>
            <option>Less than 3 months</option>
            <option>3–12 months</option>
            <option>Over a year</option>
          </select>

          <label for='coping'>What already helps you cope?</label>
          <input id='coping' type='text' placeholder='People, activities, tools'>

          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
            <button class='btn' id='buildQuestions' type='button'>Create question list</button>
            <button class='btn ghost' id='clearQuestions' type='button'>Reset</button>
          </div>

          <div id='questionsOutput' class='output' aria-live='polite'>Your tailored prompts will appear here.</div>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px'>
            <button class='btn' id='copyQuestions' type='button'>Copy prompts</button>
            <button class='btn ghost' id='downloadQuestions' type='button'>Download .txt</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start'>
        <div style='max-width:640px'>
          <strong>Contact and boundaries</strong>
          <p class='small' style='margin-top:6px'>Messages sent via this site are checked during regular business hours. This is not emergency contact. I respect clinical confidentiality with standard professional limits. If immediate help is needed, call emergency services or a local crisis line.</p>
        </div>
        <div style='text-align:right'>
          <div class='small'>Want a quick consult? <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' class='btn' style='display:inline-block;margin-top:6px'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
          <div class='small' style='margin-top:8px'>Questions? <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Session Planner logic
    function buildSessionPlan(){
      const focus = document.getElementById('focus').value.trim() || 'General focus';
      const freq = document.getElementById('freq').value;
      const length = document.getElementById('length').value;
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value.trim() || 'Explore the issue and identify next steps';

      const sessions = [];
      const titles = ['Start: orient & story','Explore patterns & resources','Skill-focused work','Refine goals & next steps'];
      for(let i=0;i<4;i++){
        sessions.push({week: i+1, title: titles[i], focus: i===0 ? 'Introduce focus & gather context' : i===1 ? 'Explore patterns and triggers' : i===2 ? 'Introduce practice or skill work' : 'Review progress & plan next steps'});
      }

      let summary = `Session Plan — ${focus}\nFrequency: ${freq} | Session length: ${length}\nGoal: ${goal}\n\n`;
      sessions.forEach(s=>{
        summary += `Session ${s.week}: ${s.title} — ${s.focus}\n`;
      });
      summary += `\nNotes: Bring any recent examples that show where this shows up.\n`;
      return summary;
    }

    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent = buildSessionPlan();
    });

    document.getElementById('clearPlan').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.getElementById('focus').value='';
      document.getElementById('goal').value='';
      document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent='Your planner summary will appear here.';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click',async ()=>{
      const text = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent;
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); alert('Summary copied to clipboard'); }catch(e){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); }
    });

    document.getElementById('downloadPlan').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const text = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent;
      const blob = new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a'); a.href=url; a.download='session-plan.txt'; a.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

    // Self-screening intake wizard
    function buildQuestions(){
      const concernsRaw = document.getElementById('concerns').value.trim();
      const concerns = concernsRaw ? concernsRaw.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean) : [];
      const duration = document.getElementById('duration').value;
      const coping = document.getElementById('coping').value.trim();

      const prompts = [];
      prompts.push('What is the single change you most want from therapy in the next two months?');
      if(concerns.length){
        prompts.push('Examples of when these concerns come up:');
        concerns.forEach((c,i)=>prompts.push(`${i+1}. ${c} — one short example`));
      }
      prompts.push(`How long this has been going on: ${duration}`);
      prompts.push('What has helped even a little?');
      if(coping) prompts.push(`Current supports: ${coping}`);

      prompts.push('Things I worry might get in the way of making progress');

      return prompts.join('\n\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('buildQuestions').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.getElementById('questionsOutput').textContent = buildQuestions();
    });

    document.getElementById('clearQuestions').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.getElementById('concerns').value='';
      document.getElementById('coping').value='';
      document.getElementById('questionsOutput').textContent='Your tailored prompts will appear here.';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyQuestions').addEventListener('click',async ()=>{
      const text = document.getElementById('questionsOutput').textContent;
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); alert('Prompts copied to clipboard'); }catch(e){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); }
    });

    document.getElementById('downloadQuestions').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const text = document.getElementById('questionsOutput').textContent;
      const blob = new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a'); a.href=url; a.download='intake-prompts.txt'; a.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

    // Basic contact/send stub
    document.getElementById('primarySend').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){ alert('Please add your name and email before sending.'); return; }
      alert('Thanks — your note was recorded locally. We will follow up via email to arrange our first time together.');
      // Note: in a live site this would POST to a secure server. This demo stores no private data here.
    });

    // Small UX: open planner focus
    document.getElementById('plannerOpen').addEventListener('click',()=>{ document.getElementById('focus').focus(); });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — private_practice_therapist

This chunk provides the contact page and usage notes for the local interactive tools.

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — the full contact page with two interactive tools built in pure HTML/CSS/JS.

What the page does:
- Session Planner: build a concise 4-session plan by specifying focus, cadence, session length, and a short goal. The planner generates a plain-text summary you can copy or download as a .txt file for your records or to bring to an intake session.
- Self-screening intake wizard: answer short prompts about concerns, duration, and coping supports. It produces a short list of prompts and conversation starters to bring to the first consult. Results can be copied or downloaded as .txt.

Technical notes:
- All functionality runs client-side. No external services or third-party CDNs are required.
- The page references an SVG pattern at `assets/img/pattern.svg` for visual texture. Ensure that file exists in your assets folder when you serve the page.
- Buttons that say {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and the CTA link are placeholders. Replace these placeholders with your practice's preferred labels and links.

Accessibility & safety:
- Outputs are shown in readable, selectable text areas and announced to screen readers via aria-live.
- The site includes a brief confidentiality and crisis note. This is not a substitute for emergency or crisis services.

How to test locally:
1. Place this file in the site root alongside the other pages (index.html, about.html, etc.).
2. Make sure assets/img/pattern.svg exists in the relative path.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. Try the Session Planner and Self-screening widgets. Use the Copy and Download buttons.

Placeholder list to replace in your build:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Clinical reminder for copy editors:
- Maintain non-diagnostic, supportive language. Avoid promising outcomes or making medical claims.
- Keep the crisis & confidentiality note visible and unchanged unless reviewed by your clinician.

If you need a variation (different fields, more sessions, CSV download), I can provide an adjusted version of the client-side scripts."}
